{"title": "Marked for Negation (Condition)", "pageid": 25572, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Marked_for_Negation_(Condition)", "categories": ["Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Generic_Force_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Force_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Generic_Force_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Force_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Generic_Force_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Force_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Generic Force Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Generic_Force_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Force_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/Generic_Force_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Marked for Negation</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>The affected entity is within range of the Netherbrain's <a href=\"/wiki/Orb_of_Negation\" title=\"Orb of Negation\">Orb of Negation</a>.</li>\n<li>The orb will explode on its turn, dealing <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">20~200</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a> damage. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">OBLITERATIONORB</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:OBLITERATIONORB+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:OBLITERATIONORB+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Marked_for_Negation\">Sources of Marked for Negation</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Orb_of_Negation\" title=\"Orb of Negation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Ex